      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of obsolescence is a heavy weight to carry, suggesting a deep sense of existential exhaustion. When the world feels like it's moved on without you, it's natural to question your own place in it. Perhaps the purpose isn't something grand and external, but something small and deeply personal that you can choose to build right now. Even a tiny act of self-compassion can be a starting point for redefining what \"your story\" means.",
      "source": "target",
